---
title: HTML Sitemap
navTitle: Sitemap
description: A complete list of every page and guide on ByteWise IT Tips, organised by category.
intro: Every page on ByteWise IT Tips in one place.
slug: sitemap
date: 2026-11-07
---
<div class="sitemap-cols">
<section>
<h2>Main pages</h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="/articles/">All articles</a></li>
<li><a href="/categories/">Categories</a></li>
<li><a href="/search/">Search</a></li>
{%- for l in navigation.footerAbout %}<li><a href="{{ l.url }}">{{ l.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
{%- for l in navigation.footerLegal %}{% if l.url != "/sitemap/" %}<li><a href="{{ l.url }}">{{ l.label }}</a></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
</section>
{%- for c in categories %}
{%- set list = collections.articles | byCategory(c.slug) %}
<section>
<h2><a href="/category/{{ c.slug }}/">{{ c.name }}</a></h2>
<ul>{% for p in list %}<li><a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.data.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
</section>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
